    (property "Note" "LIT = THE LOAD SWITCH IS DELIVERING. It hangs on UMBILICAL_POS12, the LT1641 output, so it is dark with the toggle off and dark when the -1 has latched on a fault - the one indication the latching design needs. It does not say the instrument is plugged in" (at 91.44 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
