    (property "Dir" "ref" (at 85.09 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "From" "module/power-entry" (at 85.09 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Figure" "dig-gnd-topology" (at 85.09 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
  (text "AUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. Two parts and one series path, on the jack board.\n\n[UMBILICAL_POS12] The LT1641's output, not the analog +12 V: lit = the load switch is delivering, dark = toggle\noff or latched. It crosses to this board on J-B2B-MOD pin 19.\n\n[AGND_MOD] The cathode returns on AGND_MOD across J-B2B-MOD's five ground pins, the only ground that crosses\nto the jack board. Where AGND_MOD meets PWR_GND and DIG_GND is dig-gnd-topology's question, not this sheet's." (at 154.94 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cfa9face-4d19-5b26-a1b0-3f027f67247d))
